characters.
    Following to team names, there will be a non-negative integer G on a single line which stands for', 'For each tournament, you must output the tournament name in a single line. In the next T lines you
must output the standings, according to the rules above. Notice that should the tie-breaker be the
lexographic order, it must be done case insenstive. The output format for each line is shown bellow:
[a]) T eam_name [b]p, [c]g ([d]-[e]-[f ]), [g]gd ([h]-[i])
   Where:

