 0 0 0
 1 0 5
 0 0 0
 0 1 2
 1 1 0

 Entrada                                            Saı́da

 12 5                                               2
 4 4 2 3 7
 0 0 0 1 0
 7 4 7 0 6
 1 2 3 3 2
 0 0 0 0 0
 4 0 9 10 10
 0 1 0 0 0
 1 2 0 2 3
 10 10 10 1 0
 0 3 3 3 4
 10 10 0 10 10
 1 1 2 0 9', 'See statement.', 'See statement.', '1 ≤ N ≤ 100 e 1 ≤ M ≤ 100), indicando; 0 ≤ Xj ≤ 100, para; 1 ≤ j ≤ M ), informando o número de gols do i-ésimo ', '[]'::jsonb, 'O(N log N)');
