The second line contains $a_i$ ($|a_i| \le 10^4$).', 'Print the minimum possible weakness with absolute/relative error $10^{-6}$.', '$1 \le n \le 2\cdot 10^5$', '[{"input":"3\n1 2 3","output":"1.000000000000000"}]'::jsonb, 'O(N log N)');
