 1 1
 1 100000000
 100000000 1
 100000000 100000000

 Sample input 3                       Sample output 3
 5                                    400000000 399999997
 50000000 1
 50000000 99999999
 1 50000000
 99999999 50000000
 50000001 50000001

ICPC', 'The first line contains an integer V (1 ≤ V ≤ 105 ) representing the number of vegetable plants in
Alice and Bob’s field. Each of the next V lines describes a different vegetable plant with two integers
X and Y (1 ≤ X, Y ≤ 108 ), indicating the coordinates of the plant, in millimeters. No two plants have
the same location.', 'Output a line with two integers P and A representing respectively the perimeter in millimeters and
the area in squared millimeters of the fence that Alice and Bob want to build.

ICPC', '1 ≤ V ≤ 105 ) representing the number of vegetable pla; 1 ≤ X, Y ≤ 108 ), indicating the coordinates of the pl', '[]'::jsonb, 'O(N log N)');
