Then $m$ edges.

Then $u$.', 'Print the total weight and the list of chosen edge indices.', '$1 \le n \le 3\cdot 10^5$, $0 \le m \le 3\cdot 10^5$', '[{"input":"3 3\n1 2 3\n2 3 4\n1 3 5\n1","output":"7\n1 2"}]'::jsonb, 'O(N log N)');
