letter “G” or the uppercase letter “B”, representing that the soil quality of a parcel is good or
bad, respectively. The description of the kingdom’s parcels is made from North to South, and
from West to East.', 'Output a single line with an integer indicating the maximum number of parcels Javasar
can obtain, whilst meeting his requirements, if he optimally leverages the MDT.

ICPC', '1 ≤ N, M ≤ 1000), indicating the length (in', '[]'::jsonb, 'O(N log N)');
